格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Conversation Landmarks (对话地标) for DeepSeek Harness — fixed navigation and hover previews for long agent conversations.","id":"gh:1337631521","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-conversation-landmarks","slug":"mantonlove/dsh-conversation-landmarks","topics":["ai-agents","chat-ui","conversation-navigation","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Conversation Landmarks (对话地标) for DeepSeek Harness — fixed navigation and hover previews for long ag"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"arks (对话地标) for DeepSeek Harness — fixed navigation and hover previews for long agent conversations."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Conversation Landmarks for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Conversation Landmarks is an independent DeepSeek Harness Web plugin for navigating long conversatio"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ns. It adds a fixed, vertically centered landmark rail to the left edge of the conversation workspac"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e. Each line represents one direct user task rather than every individual message."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Keeps the complete landmark rail fixed and centered in the whole conversation column while it scro"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"lls.\n- Hides the rail until at least three user tasks exist (it appears from the third line).\n- Sele"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"cts the line nearest the pointer. The selected line becomes longest and pure white; the two lines on"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" each side taper down (28/20/16px) to the resting length.\n- Shows a compact preview of the user requ"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"est and the latest following Assistant answer.\n- Loads older history when necessary, then scrolls to"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" the selected user message with a highlight so the jump target stays fully visible.\n- Uses the offic"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ial session projection and `conversation.input.dock` Client slot extension points. It does not patch"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" DeepSeek Harness source files.\n- Performs no plugin-owned network requests and collects no telemetr"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"eepSeek Harness source files.\n- Performs no plugin-owned network requests and collects no telemetry."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Requirements: DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2` or later and its supported Node.js version."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Install the prebuilt plugin into the Web profile, then restart Web:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The repository commits the required `lib/` artifacts, so this GitHub install does not ask pnpm to ru"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"n a package build script."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Open the actual URL printed after `dsh web:` in the startup output. The default is `http://127.0.0.1"},{"id":"p12s2","text":":3080`, but the address can differ when the port or host is configured."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"If you run DeepSeek Harness from its source checkout, use the same commands with `pnpm dsh`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Remove the plugin with:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Prompt for an AI coding agent"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"You can paste this into an agent that has terminal access to your DeepSeek Harness installation:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> Install `github:mantonlove/dsh-conversation-landmarks#v0.1.1` into the DeepSeek Harness `web` prof"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ile with `dsh plugin`, restart `dsh web`, and tell me the actual URL printed after `dsh web:`. Do no"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"t edit DeepSeek Harness source files."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The package is a Cordis Service plugin. Its Host half registers the `conversationLandmarks` session "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"projection through `ctx.sessionProjections`. Its browser half mounts through `conversation.input.doc"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"k`, then renders the fixed rail in a portal."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Feedback"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Report bugs or request features in Issues. Please search existing issues before opening a new one."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Status"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"This is a community project, not an official DeepSeek release. The current compatibility target is D"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"eepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
